PSBMD9,2,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p>Andre wants to save $40 to buy a gift for his dad. Andre's neighbor will pay him weekly to mow the lawn, but Andre always gives a $2 donation to the food bank in weeks when he earns money. Andre calculates that it will take him 5 weeks to earn the money for his dad's gift. He draws a tape diagram to represent the situation.</p>
