PSBCY9Z,1,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p>&nbsp;There are four ways to make <img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=3ac140028c4cf4978eae9a6bb8a85879&amp;cw=28&amp;ch=17&amp;cb=16"" width=""28"" height=""17"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;4&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;""><span style=""font-size: 100%; display: inline-block;""></span> by multiplying powers of 10 with smaller, positive exponents.</p>
<p><img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -49px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=375571d0693e969a0a271bf8e9960163&amp;cw=142&amp;ch=97&amp;cb=48"" width=""142"" height=""97"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#183;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#183;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#183;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;mspace linebreak=&uml;newline&uml;/&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#183;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#183;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;2&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;mspace linebreak=&uml;newline&uml;/&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#183;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;mspace linebreak=&uml;newline&uml;/&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;2&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#183;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;2&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;""></p>
<p>(This list is complete if you don't pay attention to the order you write them in. For example, we are only counting <img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=8701be985fd8590f086693c6801ceb62&amp;cw=66&amp;ch=17&amp;cb=16"" width=""66"" height=""17"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#183;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;""><span style=""font-size: 100%; display: inline-block;""></span> and&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=c0b1c36ad2b360c4936ee478546603b2&amp;cw=66&amp;ch=17&amp;cb=16"" width=""66"" height=""17"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#183;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;""><span style=""font-size: 100%; display: inline-block;""></span> once.)</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>How many ways are there to make <img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=2b2ff78776ea2bbd368a3c0a980339f1&amp;cw=28&amp;ch=17&amp;cb=16"" width=""28"" height=""17"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;6&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;""><span style=""font-size: 100%; display: inline-block;""></span> by multiplying smaller powers of 10 together?</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><ast-r type=""text"" marker=""1""></ast-r></p>",10,10,,,469527
