PRABKCY5,1,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p>Recall that the volume of a sphere is given by the formula&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>&#960;r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
