PSBBZFQ,3,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Algebraic Expression,"<p>A trail mix recipe asks for 4 cups of raisins for every 6 cups of peanuts. There is proportional relationship between the amount of raisins,&nbsp;<em>r</em>&nbsp;(cups), and the amount of peanuts,&nbsp;<em>p</em>&nbsp;(cups),&nbsp;in this recipe.</p>
