</tr>
<tr>
<td style=""width: 50.1029%; text-align: center;"">small</td>
<td style=""width: 49.862%; text-align: center;"">11.60</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=""width: 50.1029%; text-align: center;"">medium</td>
<td style=""width: 49.862%; text-align: center;"">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=""width: 50.1029%; text-align: center;"">large</td>
<td style=""width: 49.862%; text-align: center;"">16.25</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>You had a coupon that made the price of a large pizza $13.00. For what percent off was the coupon?</p>
