PRABET9F,1,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p>One year ago, Clare was 4 feet 6 inches tall. Now Clare is 4 feet 10 inches tall. By what percentage did Clare’s height increase in the last year? &nbsp;</p>
