<li>They delivered&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>of the remaining cookies to a local nursing home.</li>
<li>Next, they gave 3 cookies to some neighborhood kids.</li>
<li>They wrapped up&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>of the remaining cookies to save for their friends.<br><br></li>
