PSBTFF,5,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p>Find the measure of the angles in one column. Your partner will work on the other column. Check in with your partner after you finish each row. Your answers in each row should be the same. If your answers aren’t the same, work together to find the error and correct it.</p>
