PSB26A,3,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p>The temperature in degrees Fahrenheit, <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>F</mi></math>, is related to the temperature in degrees Celsius,&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>C</mi></math>,&nbsp;by the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn></math>,</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
