PSBBCXS,1,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Algebraic Expression,"<p>There are many right rectangular prisms with one edge of length 5 units and another edge of length 3 units. Let <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>s</mi></math> represent the length of the third edge and <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>V</mi></math> represent the volume of these prisms.</p>
