PSBBCZ3,1,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Algebraic Expression,"<p>There are many cylinders with radius 5 units. Let <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>h</mi></math> represent the height and <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>V</mi></math> represent the volume of these cylinders.</p>
