PSBBC6R,4,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Algebraic Expression,"<p>Write an equation that relates the volume <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>V</mi></math> and height&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>h</mi></math>.</p>
