PRABEVSZ,1,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Algebraic Expression,"<p>There are 16 cups in a gallon. The equation <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>g</mi></math> gives the number of cups in terms of the number of gallons. Write another equation for this situation, giving the number of gallons in terms of the number of cups:&nbsp;</p>
