PSBBZQT,3,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p>The high temperature this Sunday is expected to be 5 degrees warmer than the high temperature this Saturday. Using the line <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>89</mn></math>,&nbsp;how many more cups of lemonade should Lin expect to sell on Sunday than Saturday?&nbsp;</p>
