<p><ast-r type=""text"" marker=""1""></ast-r> more cups of lemonade</p>",10,10,,,296579
PSBRR9,2,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p>The deli owner found that the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>120</mn></math> is a good fit for the data. Use this equation to predict how many bowls of soup they might sell on a day when the high temperature is 32 degrees.</p>
