PSBRR9,3,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p>The high temperature this Saturday is expected to be 10 degrees colder than the high temperature this Friday. Using the line <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>120</mn></math>,&nbsp;how many more bowls of soup should the deli expect to sell on Saturday than Friday?&nbsp;</p>
