PSBB8E7,2,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Algebraic Expression,"<p><img src=""//resources.assistments.org/fetch/C/b7da7781-bd4d-4e16-a872-1ea8b502beec.png""></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Here are a cone, a sphere, and a cylinder that all have the same radii and heights.</p>
