PSBBHR6,1,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p><img src=""//resources.assistments.org/fetch/C/9b073148-e727-42e5-b828-1f1644629529.png"" width=""295"" height=""274""></p>
<p>The volume of this sphere with radius <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>r</mi></math> is <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>288</mn><mi mathvariant=""normal"">&#960;</mi></math>.</p>
