PSB89M,1,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p>A coin-operated bouncy ball dispenser has a large glass sphere that holds many spherical balls. The large glass sphere has a radius of&nbsp;9 inches. Each bouncy ball has radius of&nbsp;1 inch and sits inside the dispenser.</p>
