PRABFCBV,1,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p>Lin and Andre start walking toward each other at the same time from opposite ends of 22-mile walking trail. Lin walks at a speed of 2.5 miles per hour. Andre walks at a speed of 3 miles per hour.</p>
