PRABQACZ,1,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p>Here is a rough map of a neighborhood.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img src=""//resources.assistments.org/fetch/C/6c1c01dc-71bf-45b6-b5aa-ff4f01a06bd2.png""></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>There are 4 mail routes during the week.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>On Monday, the mail truck follows the route A-B-E-F-G-H-A, which is 14 miles long.</li>
<li>On Tuesday, the mail truck follows the route B-C-D-E-F-G-B, which is 22 miles long.</li>
<li>On Wednesday, the truck follows the route A-B-C-D-E-F-G-H-A, which is 24 miles long.</li>
<li>On Thursday, the mail truck follows the route B-E-F-G-B.</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>How long is the route on Thursdays?</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><ast-r type=""text"" marker=""1""></ast-r>miles</p>",12,12,,,308662
