PSBBDV8,1,Fill-in-the-blank(s),Numeric,"<p>A group of hikers park their car at a trail head and walk into the forest to a campsite. The next morning, they head out on a hike from their campsite walking at a steady rate. The graph shows their distance in miles, <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>d</mi></math>, from the car after&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>h</mi></math> hours of hiking.</p>
