PSBQ8P,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Elena and Han are discussing how to write the repeating decimal&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=6c4dcfca8a872a220f2790a4c20a2f9c&amp;cw=73&amp;ch=18&amp;cb=17"" width=""73"" height=""18"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mi&raquo;x&laquo;/mi&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;=&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;0&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;.&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;13&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;menclose notation=&uml;top&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;7&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/menclose&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">&nbsp;as a fraction. Hans says that&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=c765ee1dbdb8f7b6a93fe9f7fa343a22&amp;cw=45&amp;ch=18&amp;cb=17"" alt=""undefined"" width=""45"" height=""18"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;0&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;.&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;13&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;menclose notation=&uml;top&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;7&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/menclose&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">&nbsp;equals&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -12px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=29fdeae34f246e7c8ecd6971858dbcff&amp;cw=58&amp;ch=35&amp;cb=23"" alt=""13764 over 99900"" width=""58"" height=""35"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;13764&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;99900&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">. ""I calculated&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=cb825ace9ca21dce419bd49893d126f1&amp;cw=141&amp;ch=18&amp;cb=17"" alt=""1000 x space equals space 137.77 top enclose 7"" width=""141"" height=""18"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1000&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mi&raquo;x&laquo;/mi&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;=&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;137&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;.&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;77&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;menclose notation=&uml;top&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;7&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/menclose&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">&nbsp;because the decimal&nbsp;begins repeating after 3 digits. Then I subtracted to get&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=2efecb20ebd729475cc6cdcdc829086a&amp;cw=121&amp;ch=13&amp;cb=12"" alt=""999 x space equals space 137.64"" width=""121"" height=""13"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;999&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mi&raquo;x&laquo;/mi&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;=&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;137&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;.&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;64&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">. Then I multiplied by 100&nbsp;to get rid of the decimal:&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=d55775c3dd1590d5e7e800c9d50257ce&amp;cw=136&amp;ch=13&amp;cb=12"" alt=""99900 x space equals space 13764"" width=""136"" height=""13"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;99900&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mi&raquo;x&laquo;/mi&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;=&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;13764&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">. And finally, I divided to get&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -12px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=29fdeae34f246e7c8ecd6971858dbcff&amp;cw=58&amp;ch=35&amp;cb=23"" alt=""undefined"" width=""58"" height=""35"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;13764&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;99900&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">."" Elena says that&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=c765ee1dbdb8f7b6a93fe9f7fa343a22&amp;cw=45&amp;ch=18&amp;cb=17"" alt=""0.13 top enclose 7"" width=""45"" height=""18"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;0&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;.&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;13&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;menclose notation=&uml;top&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;7&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/menclose&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">&nbsp;equals&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -12px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=845c322244256f792c701e584bfc7a7e&amp;cw=38&amp;ch=35&amp;cb=23"" alt=""124 over 900"" width=""38"" height=""35"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;124&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;900&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">. ""I calculated&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=0c724c7b3b29b21c24058e62ca131607&amp;cw=101&amp;ch=18&amp;cb=17"" alt=""10 x space equals space 1.37 top enclose 7"" width=""101"" height=""18"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;10&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mi&raquo;x&laquo;/mi&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;=&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;.&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;37&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;menclose notation=&uml;top&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;7&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/menclose&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">&nbsp;because one digit repeats. Then I subtracted to get&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=b80897a55c8626d540d2c39bc9fa98fb&amp;cw=81&amp;ch=13&amp;cb=12"" alt=""9 x space equals space 1.24"" width=""81"" height=""13"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;9&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mi&raquo;x&laquo;/mi&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;=&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;.&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;24&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">. Then I did what Han did to get&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=f13b5bf7122023e053821a8eee66552c&amp;cw=96&amp;ch=13&amp;cb=12"" alt=""900 x space equals space 124"" width=""96"" height=""13"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;900&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mi&raquo;x&laquo;/mi&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;=&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;124&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">&nbsp;and&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -12px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=4e856f3ebc21bfeae5c320769c565698&amp;cw=74&amp;ch=35&amp;cb=23"" alt=""x space equals space 124 over 900"" width=""74"" height=""35"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mi&raquo;x&laquo;/mi&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;=&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;124&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;900&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Do you agree with&nbsp;either of them?</p>",,,Han is correct || Elena is correct || Both are correct || Neither is correct,Both are correct,74236
PRABQM8U,1,Multiple Choice (select all),Check All That Apply,<p>Select&nbsp;<strong>all</strong>&nbsp;the true statements.</p>,,,"Given a box plot, it is always possible to calculate the mean of the data. || Given a box plot, it is always possible to calculate the median of the data. || Given a box plot, it is always possible to construct a corresponding dot plot. || Given a dot plot, it is always possible to construct a corresponding box plot. || Given a histogram, it is always possible to construct a corresponding box plot.","Given a box plot, it is always possible to calculate the median of the data. || Given a dot plot, it is always possible to construct a corresponding box plot.",193572
