PSBR54,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Jada and Elena learned that 8% of students have asthma. They want to know the probability that in a team of 4 students, at least one of them has asthma. To simulate this, they put 25 slips of paper in a bag. Two of the slips say &ldquo;asthma.&rdquo; Next, they take four papers out of the bag and record whether at least one of them says &ldquo;asthma.&rdquo; They repeat this process 15 times.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Jada says they could improve the accuracy of their simulation by using 100 slips of paper and marking 8 of them.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Elena says they could improve the accuracy of their simulation by conducting 30 trials instead of 15.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Do you agree with either of them?</p>",,,I agree with Elena || I agree with Jada || I agree with both of them || I agree with neither of them,I agree with Elena,78469
PSBB6PY,3,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p><img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -12px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=e534c4e4961809e86819cb822569bf2f&amp;cw=76&amp;ch=35&amp;cb=23"" alt=""3 over 5 space bottom enclose space space space space space space space space end enclose space 3 over 7"" width=""76"" height=""35"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;5&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;menclose notation=&uml;bottom&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;/menclose&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;7&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;""></p>",,,&lt; || = || &gt;,&gt;,323873
PSBB6HD,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Una cinta tiene 30 pulgadas de longitud. Debes cortarla en varios trozos, todos de la misma longitud.</p>
