PRABEVAH,1,Multiple Choice (select all),Check All That Apply,"<p>A heron is perched in a tree 50 feet above sea level. Directly below the heron, a pelican is flying 17 feet above sea level. Directly below the birds is a trout, swimming 23 feet&nbsp;below sea level.</p>
