PSBB5SU,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Andre draws this tape diagram for <img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -12px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=f88b5fbdbbcd75d702e9d38a7e9fe4c5&amp;cw=46&amp;ch=35&amp;cb=23"" width=""46"" height=""35"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#247;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;2&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">:<br><br></p>
<p><img src=""/images/assistments/393514.jpg"" width=""514"" height=""166""></p>
<p><br>Andre says that <img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -12px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=c4c5b9e987b5cb6aa0efdc61c3cb4602&amp;cw=91&amp;ch=35&amp;cb=23"" width=""91"" height=""35"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#247;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;2&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;=&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;4&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;""> because there are 4 groups of&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -12px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=2059e346ca06d89816db3df147df9eb5&amp;cw=18&amp;ch=35&amp;cb=23"" width=""18"" height=""35"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;2&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;""> and&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -12px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=9f9534cbd9d62ad68c7283e54cf52cdf&amp;cw=18&amp;ch=35&amp;cb=23"" width=""18"" height=""35"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;""> left. Do you agree with Andre?</p>",,,Agree || Disagree,Disagree,318653
