PRABG6MX,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Clare&rsquo;s recipe for banana bread won&rsquo;t fit in her favorite pan. The pan is&nbsp;<span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><img src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=9d14b94d05d1a6bb5394de596f08cb11"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;8&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;2&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">inches by 11 inches by 2 inches. The batter fills the pan to the very top, and when baking, the batter spills over the sides. To avoid spills, there should be about an inch between the top of the batter and the rim of the pan.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Clare has another pan that is 9 inches by 9 inches by&nbsp;<span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><img src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=d28470bc2ab4c0cc6228ec9f3b81da37"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;2&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;2&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">inches. If she uses&nbsp;this pan, will&nbsp;the batter spill over during baking?&nbsp;</p>",,,Yes || No,Yes,167762
