</div>",,,The perimeter is&nbsp;x + y. || The perimeter is&nbsp;xy. || The perimeter is&nbsp;2(x + y). || The perimeter is&nbsp;2xy. || The perimeter is&nbsp;2x + 2y. || The area is&nbsp;x + y. || The area is&nbsp;xy. || The area is&nbsp;2xy.,The perimeter is&nbsp;2(x + y). || The perimeter is&nbsp;2x + 2y. || The area is&nbsp;xy.,1366
PSBBSW7,2,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Han and Priya want to know the mean height of the 30 students in their dance class. They each select a random sample of 5 students.</p>
