PRABFMAH,1,Multiple Choice (select all),Check All That Apply,"<p>Pineapples were packed in three large crates. For each crate, the weight of every&nbsp;pineapple in the crate&nbsp;was recorded. Here are three box plots that summarize&nbsp;the weights in each crate.</p>
