PRABQPKS,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Tyler has run 15 miles this month. For the rest of the month, he plans to run the same number of miles each day. There are 12 days left in the month. Before the end of the month, Tyler needs to run at least 35 miles to meet his goal.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
