PRABJKA9,1,Multiple Choice (select all),Check All That Apply,<p>Select&nbsp;<strong>all&nbsp;</strong>of the statements that are true.&nbsp;Be prepared to explain your reasoning.</p>,,,1. 4 - 2(3 + 7) = 4 - 2 · 3 - 2 · 7 || 2. 4 - 2(3 + 7) = 4 + -2 · 3 + -2 · 7 || 3. 4 - 2(3 + 7) = 4 - 2 · 3 + 2 · 7 || 4. 4 - 2(3 + 7) = 4 - (2 · 3 + 2 · 7),1. 4 - 2(3 + 7) = 4 - 2 · 3 - 2 · 7 || 2. 4 - 2(3 + 7) = 4 + -2 · 3 + -2 · 7 || 4. 4 - 2(3 + 7) = 4 - (2 · 3 + 2 · 7),537870
