PSB3HE,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>A cube has side length 10 inches. Jada says the surface area of the cube is 600 in<sup>2</sup>, and Noah says the surface area of the cube is 3,600 in<sup>2</sup>. Here is how each of them reasoned:</p>
