</td>
<td style=""width: 189.801px; text-align: center;"">
<p>Lin's solution:&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=""width: 189.801px; text-align: center;""><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>14</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mspace linebreak=""newline""></mspace><mn>14</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mspace linebreak=""newline""></mspace><mn>12</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mspace linebreak=""newline""></mspace><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></td>
<td style=""width: 189.801px; text-align: center;""><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>14</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mspace linebreak=""newline""></mspace><mn>7</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace linebreak=""newline""></mspace><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace linebreak=""newline""></mspace><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Do you agree with either of them?&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>",,,Noah's Solution || Lin's Solution || Both Solutions || Neither Solutions,Both Solutions,83813
