PSBJTV,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Jada explains how she finds&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>15</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mn>23</mn></math>:</p>
