<p>Lin says that <img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -12px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=a5cfa0789fbd2cdcb811ede0534c4b56&amp;cw=107&amp;ch=35&amp;cb=23"" width=""107"" height=""35"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;4&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#247;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;4&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;=&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;5&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;4&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">&nbsp;because there are 5 groups of <img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -12px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=360b69e02bb981911a035a15fdb30bfe&amp;cw=18&amp;ch=35&amp;cb=23"" width=""18"" height=""35"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;3&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;4&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">&nbsp;and <img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -12px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=4c62bfb23ff1780820b8a8ae044cbdcd&amp;cw=18&amp;ch=35&amp;cb=23"" width=""18"" height=""35"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mfrac&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;1&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;4&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/mfrac&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">&nbsp;left. Do you agree with Lin?</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>",,,Agree || Disagree,Disagree,20000
