PSBU7J,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>A restaurant is offering 2 specials: 10 burritos for $12, or 6 burritos for $7.50. Noah needs 60 burritos for his party. Should he buy 6 orders of the 10-burrito special or 10 orders of the 6-burrito special?&nbsp;</p>",,,10 burritos for $12 || 6 burritos for $7.50,10 burritos for $12,96695
PRABQN7D,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Clare has a recipe for yellow cake. She uses&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>9</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;cups of flour to make 4 cakes. Noah will follow the same recipe. He will make&nbsp;<em>c&nbsp;</em>cakes using&nbsp;<em>f&nbsp;</em>cups of flour.</p>
