PRABEU3Y,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Priya has a recipe for banana bread. She uses&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>7</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;cups of flour to make 3 loaves of banana bread.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p>Andre will follow the same recipe. He will make&nbsp;<em>b</em>&nbsp;loaves of banana bread&nbsp;using&nbsp;<em>f</em>&nbsp;cups of flour.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Which of these&nbsp;equations represents the relationship between&nbsp;<em>b</em>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<em>f</em>?</p>
</div>",,,"<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mi>f</mi></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>f</mi></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>f</mi></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>f</mi></math></p>","<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>f</mi></math></p>",247330
