PSBCBW4,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Andre and Jada are discussing how to write&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>17</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;as a decimal.</p>
