PRABESGF,1,Multiple Choice (select all),Check All That Apply,"<p>Last week, the price, in dollars, of a gallon of gasoline was&nbsp;<em>g</em>. This week, the price of gasoline per gallon increased by 5%. Which expressions represent this week's price, in dollars, of a gallon of gasoline? Select&nbsp;<strong>all</strong>&nbsp;that apply.</p>",,,<p><em>g</em> + 0.05</p> || <p><em>g</em> + 0.05<em>g</em></p> || <p>1.05<em>g</em></p> || <p>0.05<em>g</em></p> || <p>(1 + 0.05)<em>g</em></p>,<p><em>g</em> + 0.05<em>g</em></p> || <p>1.05<em>g</em></p> || <p>(1 + 0.05)<em>g</em></p>,586483
