PRABFK4A,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Priya asked each of five&nbsp;friends to&nbsp;attempt to throw&nbsp;a ball in a trash can until they succeeded. She recorded the number of unsuccessful attempts&nbsp;made by each friend as: 1, 8, 6, 2, 4. Priya made a mistake: The 8 in the data set should&nbsp;have been 18.</p>
