</li>
</ul>
<p><img src=""/images/assistments/264361.jpg"" alt="""" width=""372"" height=""204""></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Are any of the news reports misleading?&nbsp;</p>",,,Yes || No,Yes,69854
