PRABE3F4,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Priya decomposed a square into 16 smaller, equal-size squares and then cut out 4 of the small squares and attached them around the outside of original square to make a new figure.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<div>
<div>
<div>
<p>How does the area of her new figure compare with that of the original square?&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
