<p><img src=""/images/assistments/166065.jpg"" alt=""On a square grid: a rectangle with a horizontal side length between 4 and 5 units and a vertical side length between 3 and 4 units."" width=""184"" height=""137""></p>",,,"<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>×</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>4</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>×</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>4</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>×</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>×</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>","<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>4</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>×</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p>",103860
PRABFG56,1,Multiple Choice (select all),Check All That Apply,"<p>Select<strong>&nbsp;all</strong>&nbsp;of the numbers that are&nbsp;<em>greater than</em>&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>.</p>",,,"<p>1.3</p> || <p>-6</p> || <p>-12</p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p> || <p>-1</p> || <p>-4</p>","<p>1.3</p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p> || <p>-1</p> || <p>-4</p>",356660
