<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>",,,"<p>Jada cut 4 pieces of ribbon that were equal in length. She used a total of 5 feet of ribbon. How long, in feet, was each piece of ribbon she cut?</p> || <p>A chef bought 3 bags of beans. Each bag contains&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>1</mn><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math> kilograms of beans. How many kilograms of beans did she buy?</p> || <p>A printer takes <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> seconds to print a flyer. It took 75 seconds to print a batch of flyers without stopping. How many flyers were in the batch?</p>","<p>Jada cut 4 pieces of ribbon that were equal in length. She used a total of 5 feet of ribbon. How long, in feet, was each piece of ribbon she cut?</p> || <p>A printer takes <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> seconds to print a flyer. It took 75 seconds to print a batch of flyers without stopping. How many flyers were in the batch?</p>",557055
