PRABQPME,1,Multiple Choice (select all),Check All That Apply,"<p>Elena would like to know the average height of seventh graders in her school district. She measures the heights of everyone in a random sample of 20 students. The mean height of Elena&rsquo;s sample is 61 inches, and the MAD (mean absolute deviation) is 2 inches.</p>
