<p><img src=""/images/assistments/420353.jpg"" alt=""A drawing of a square pyramid."" width=""264"" height=""240""></p>",,,A rectangle smaller than the base || A quadrilateral that is not a rectangle || A rectangle the same size as the base || A triangle with a height the same as the pyramid,A triangle with a height the same as the pyramid,348992
PRABFENR,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Before refrigerators existed, some people had blocks of ice delivered to their homes.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>A delivery wagon had a storage box in the shape of a rectangular prism that was&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>7</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> feet by 6 feet by 6 feet. The cubic ice blocks stored in the box had side lengths&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>1</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> feet.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>How many ice blocks fit in the storage box?</p>",,,"<p>270</p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p> || <p>80</p> || <p>180</p>",<p>80</p>,277396
PSBR2X,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Han and Tyler are following a polenta recipe that uses 5 cups of water for every 2 cups of cornmeal.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>Han says, &ldquo;I am using 3 cups of water. I will need&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;cups of cornmeal.&rdquo;</li>
<li>Tyler says, &ldquo;I am using 3 cups of cornmeal. I will need&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;cups of water.&rdquo;</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Do you agree with either of them?</p>",,,I agree with Han || I agree with Tyler || I agree with both || I don't agree with either,I agree with both,78262
PRABPQ5B,1,Multiple Choice (select all),Check All That Apply,"<p>The equation <img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=6597606b024f03033c62db63de789951&amp;cw=64&amp;ch=17&amp;cb=16"" alt=""x squared space equals space 25"" width=""64"" height=""17"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;msup&raquo;&laquo;mi&raquo;x&laquo;/mi&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;2&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/msup&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;=&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;25&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">&nbsp;has two solutions. This is because both <img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=41bd06865590954e485a246c19fefdb9&amp;cw=90&amp;ch=13&amp;cb=12"" alt=""5 space cross times space 5 space equals space 25"" width=""90"" height=""13"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;5&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#215;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;5&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;=&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;25&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">&nbsp;, and also&nbsp;<img style=""max-width: none; vertical-align: -1px;"" src=""/pluginwiris_engine/app/showimage?formula=6952895802e236bdd77f440a18ec4b8e&amp;cw=116&amp;ch=13&amp;cb=12"" alt=""short dash 5 space cross times space short dash 5 space equals space 25"" width=""116"" height=""13"" data-mathml=""&laquo;math xmlns=&uml;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&uml;&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#8208;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;5&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#215;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#8208;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;5&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;=&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mo&raquo;&sect;#160;&laquo;/mo&raquo;&laquo;mn&raquo;25&laquo;/mn&raquo;&laquo;/math&raquo;"">. So, 5 is a solution, and also -5 is a solution.</p>
<p><br>Select <strong>all</strong> the equations that have a solution of -4.</p>",,,10 + x = 6 || 10 - x = 6 || -3x = -12 || -3x = 12 || 8 = x² || x² = 16,10 + x = 6 || -3x = 12 || x² = 16,412709
PRABEUGJ,1,Multiple Choice (select all),Check All That Apply,<p>Select&nbsp;<strong>all</strong>&nbsp;the expressions that are the result of decreasing&nbsp;<em>x</em>&nbsp;by 80%.</p>,,,"<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>80</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>80</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p>","<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>80</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p>",375713
PSBBR5Q,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Ten sixth-grade students reported the hours of sleep they get on nights before a school day. Their responses are recorded in the dot plot.<br><br></p>
<p><img src=""/images/assistments/168469.jpg"" alt=""A dot plot, hours of sleep, 5 to 12 by 1's.&nbsp; Beginning at 5, the number of dots above each increment is 1, 1, 3, 3, 2, 0, 0, 0."" width=""285"" height=""91""><br><br></p>
<p>Looking at the dot plot, Lin estimated the mean number of hours of sleep to be 8.5 hours. Noah's estimate was&nbsp;7.5 hours.&nbsp;Diego's estimate was&nbsp;6.5 hours.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Which estimate&nbsp;do you think is&nbsp;best?</p>",,,Lin's estimate || Noah's estimate || Diego's estimate,Noah's estimate,253594
