PSBQM7,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Priya&nbsp;looks at the inequality <math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>12</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;and says &ldquo;I subtract a number from 12 and want a result that is bigger than 5. That means that the solutions should be values of <em>x</em> that are smaller than something.&rdquo;</p>
