PRABFKNZ,1,Multiple Choice (select all),Check All That Apply,"<div>
<p>Noah&rsquo;s water bottle contains more than 1 quart of water but less than&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>1</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> quarts. Let&nbsp;<em>w </em>be the amount of water in Noah&rsquo;s bottle, in quarts. Select<strong>&nbsp;all</strong>&nbsp;the true statements.</p>
</div>",,,"<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>w</mi></math> could be&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>.</p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>w</mi></math> could be&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>1</mn></math>.</p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>w</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>w</mi></math> could be&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>.</p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>w</mi></math> could be&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>.</p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>w</mi></math> could be&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>.</p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>w</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>","<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>w</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>w</mi></math> could be&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>.</p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>w</mi></math> could be&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>",262820
PSBCM9V,1,Multiple Choice (select all),Check All That Apply,"<p>Select <strong>all&nbsp;</strong>of the equations that describe the situation. If you get stuck, draw&nbsp;a diagram.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>A coach formed teams of 8 from all the players in a soccer league. There are 14 teams. How many players are in the league?</p>",,,"<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>y</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>÷</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>y</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>·</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>","<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mi>y</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>·</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>",406643
