PRABETN3,1,Multiple Choice (select all),Check All That Apply,"<p>Select&nbsp;<strong>all</strong>&nbsp;the options that have the same value as&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>%</mo></math>&nbsp;of 20.</p>",,,"<p>3.5% of 20</p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>·</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p> || <p>(0.35) · 20</p> || <p>(0.035) · 20</p> || <p>7% of 10</p>",<p>3.5% of 20</p> || <p>(0.035) · 20</p> || <p>7% of 10</p>,184732
PSBUPJ,2,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Is the decimal of&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>18</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;also 0.36?</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>",,,Yes || No,Yes,93346
PRABQP65,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Each of the following gives the lengths, in inches, of the sides of a triangle. Which one is a right triangle?</p>",,,"<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math></p>","<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math></p>",315914
