PSBSP9,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>The Amazon rainforest covered 6.42 million square kilometers in 1994. In 2014, it covered only&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>50</mn><mn>59</mn></mfrac></math> as much. Which is closest to the area of the Amazon Forest in 2014?&nbsp;</p>",,,<p>6.4 million km<sup>2</sup></p> || <p>5.4 million km<sup>2</sup></p> || <p>4.4 million km<sup>2</sup></p> || <p>3.4 million km<sup>2</sup></p> || <p>2.4 million km<sup>2</sup></p>,<p>5.4 million km<sup>2</sup></p>,81898
