PSBB58,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Now, let&rsquo;s look at rectangles&nbsp;ABCD&nbsp;and&nbsp;EFGH.</p>
<p><img src=""/images/assistments/192613.jpg"" alt="""" width=""554"" height=""189""></p>
<p><br>Jada says, &ldquo;These rectangles are similar because all of the side lengths differ by 2.&rdquo; Lin says, &ldquo;These rectangles are similar. I can dilate&nbsp;AD&nbsp;and&nbsp;BC&nbsp;using a scale factor of 2 and&nbsp;AB&nbsp;and&nbsp;CD&nbsp;using a scale factor of 1.5 to make the rectangles congruent. Then I can use a translation to line up the rectangles.&rdquo; Do you agree with either Jada or Lin?&nbsp;</p>",,,Jada || Lin || Neither,Neither,9569
