PRABETQQ,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>At the beginning of the month, there were 80 ounces of peanut butter in the pantry. Now, there is&nbsp;<math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;less than that. How many ounces of peanut butter is in the pantry now?</p>",,,"<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>·</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>80</mn></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>·</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>80</mn></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p> || <p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>·</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>80</mn></math></p>","<p><math xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML""><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>·</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>80</mn></math></p>",327306
