PSBS27,1,Multiple Choice (select 1),Multiple Choice,"<p>Jada is making a scale model of the solar system. The distance from Earth to the moon is about&nbsp;2.389&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;10<sup>5</sup>&nbsp;miles. The distance from Earth to the sun is about&nbsp;9.296&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;10<sup>7</sup>&nbsp;miles. She decides to put Earth on one corner of her dresser and the moon on another corner, about a foot away. Where should she put the sun?</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<ul>
<li>On a windowsill in the same room?</li>
<li>In her kitchen, which is down the hallway?</li>
<li>A city block away?</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>",,,"on a windowsill in the same room || in her kitchen, which is down the hallway || a city block away",a city block away,83841
